    "summary": {
      "value": "Perform three dances, then take a temporary break."
    },
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> you must have mastered <strong>Dancer</strong>.</p><hr><p>At the start of your turn during a conflict, if you have <strong>no martial armor</strong> equipped, you may spend 1 Fabula Point to immediately perform <strong>up to three different dances</strong> among those you know, in the order you prefer and without paying their MP cost. If you do, you <strong>cannot perform dances in any way</strong> until the end of your next turn.</p><hr><p><strong>You Spend:</strong> @LOSS[1 fp]<br><strong>You Suffer:</strong> @EFFECT[Compendium.projectfu.heroic-skills.Item.WJD7tqc73P24UFg4]</p>",
